As per final order for the  following ;
 REASONS 10. Point No.1 :- The allegation of the prosecution against the accused is that the accused no.2 with an intention to illegally earn money, started M/s.Graniti Properties Pvt., Ltd., at No.3, 3rd cross,
10th A Main, 2nd stage, Indiranagar and purchased agricultural land in Sy.No.183, 184, 185 from CW2 to 7 and executed GPA/Agreement with them.

In this regard, the accused persons collected Rs.2,65,400/-
from CW 1 and entered into sale agreement with regard to site No.689 situated at Erandahalli,
Hoskote taluk, thereafter neither allotted the site nor returned the money paid by the CW 1, thereby cheated the CW 1.

Further, the accused no.2 entered into Memorandum of Understanding with CW 9-MD of Orange Properties with regard to marketing of said sites by announcing the free offer of a Maruthi 800 car to the customers who will purchase 30x40 site and free offer of a Maruthi swift car to the customers who will purchase 60 x 40 sites and etc., In this regard, the accused persons collected Rs.2,90,000/-
from CW 1 and entered into sale agreement with regard to site No.550 situated at Erandahalli,
Hoskote taluk , thereafter neither allotted the site nor returned the money paid by the CW 1, thereby cheated the CW 1.
